<section id="faq" class="wrap sec">
  <div class="[display:grid] [grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,400px),1fr))] [gap:clamp(40px,6vw,96px)] [align-items:start]">
    <div data-reveal class="[display:flex] [flex-direction:column] [gap:24px] [align-items:flex-start]">
      <div aria-hidden="true" style="background:#00D3F2" class="[width:120px] [height:120px] [border-radius:26px] [display:grid] [place-items:center] [transform:rotate(-4deg)]"><span class="[display:flex] [align-items:baseline] [color:#fff] [font-weight:700] [font-size:44px] [line-height:1]">faq<span style="background:#fff" class="[display:inline-block] [width:9px] [height:9px] [border-radius:2px] [transform:rotate(45deg)] [margin-left:3px]"></span></span></div>
      <h2 class="h2">Common questions</h2>
      <p class="lead [max-width:400px]">Quick answers to what most owners ask first. Have another question? <a href="#contact" class="[color:#155DFC] [font-weight:700]">Ask us here</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal id="faqList" class="[display:flex] [flex-direction:column] [gap:10px]">
      <div class="faq open"><button aria-expanded="true"><h3>What is included in the price?</h3><span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="ans"><p>Everything listed in your plan, plus the tools to run it. Scheduling, analytics and email platform costs are already covered, so there are no extra subscriptions to pay.</p><p>Every plan comes with a report, and the higher the plan, the more detailed it gets. Prices are monthly, in USD.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq"><button aria-expanded="false"><h3>How does the website process work?</h3><span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="ans"><p>It starts with a conversation about your business. From there you get a plan: a brand-new site if you don’t have one yet, or an update of your current site with your latest information.</p><p>Delivery usually takes 1 to 2 weeks, depending on complexity.</p><p>Every site includes custom design, mobile-first layouts, SEO setup and forms that send leads straight to your inbox.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq"><button aria-expanded="false"><h3>Can I change plans?</h3><span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="ans"><p>Yes. You can move up or down between levels as your business changes.</p><p>Changes apply the following month, so if you ask in January, the new plan starts in February.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq"><button aria-expanded="false"><h3>How does billing work?</h3><span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="ans"><p>Plans are billed monthly in USD at a set price. Your billing date is the day you start, and if another day of the month works better, it can be moved.</p><p>Pay by card or any other method Stripe supports. Hire both social media and email marketing and you get 10% off those two plans.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq"><button aria-expanded="false"><h3>Do you handle hosting and maintenance after launch?</h3><span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="ans"><p>Yes. Hosting and maintenance are billed monthly, separate from the website build, so your site stays online and up to date after it launches.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq"><button aria-expanded="false"><h3>Can I approve posts before they go live?</h3><span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="ans"><p>Yes. You can review and approve every post before it’s published, or leave it to us. It’s your call.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
